<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>PathKeeper | Site Strategy and Page Planner</title>
<style>
:root {
  --forest:#173d2d; --green:#2f6547; --sage:#e2ecdf;
  --cream:#f8f5ed; --paper:#fff; --brown:#79543a;
  --tan:#ead8bd; --ink:#24342b; --muted:#65746a;
  --line:#d7dfd5; --red:#8a4237; --gold:#c89c59;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);
font:15px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
header{background:linear-gradient(125deg,var(--forest),#38674a);
color:white;padding:38px 20px}
.wrap{max-width:1250px;margin:auto;padding:0 17px}
.eyebrow{color:#e7c69c;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;
letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,46px);line-height:1.1;margin:10px 0}
header p{max-width:800px;color:#e7eee8}
main{padding:22px 0 55px}
.panel{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);
border-radius:15px;padding:22px;margin:17px 0}
h2{color:var(--forest);font-size:22px;margin:0 0 9px}
h3{color:var(--green);font-size:16px}
p{margin:8px 0}
.muted,.small{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.note{background:#f3ecdf;border-left:4px solid var(--brown);
border-radius:7px;padding:12px 14px;margin:13px 0;font-size:13px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}
.stat{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);
border-radius:11px;padding:14px}
.stat strong{display:block;color:var(--forest);font-size:25px}
.toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:14px 0}
.btn{border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 14px;
font-weight:bold;background:var(--forest);color:white}
.btn.light{background:var(--sage);color:var(--forest)}
.btn.brown{background:var(--brown);color:white}
.btn.red{background:#f4e3df;color:var(--red)}
.btn.gold{background:var(--tan);color:#3b2a1e}
.btn:hover{opacity:.87}
.progress-track{height:9px;background:#e9eee7;border-radius:20px;
overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0}
.progress-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--green)}
.field-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:15px}
.field{min-width:0}
.field.full{grid-column:1/-1}
label{display:block;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5ca;
border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
textarea{min-height:85px;resize:vertical}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:2px solid #92b59a}
.question{padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0eb}
.question:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.question label{font-size:14px}
.table-wrap{overflow:auto}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:1050px;font-size:12px}
th,td{text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:9px;
border-bottom:1px solid #e7ece5}
th{position:sticky;top:0;background:#edf3eb;color:var(--forest);z-index:1}
td input,td select,td textarea{min-width:110px;padding:7px;font-size:12px}
td textarea{min-width:180px;min-height:65px}
.tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--sage);color:var(--forest);
padding:3px 7px;border-radius:5px;font-size:11px}
.section-intro{margin-bottom:15px}
.result{display:none}
.result.show{display:block}
.result-head{background:var(--forest);color:white;border-radius:11px;
padding:20px;margin-bottom:15px}
.result-head h2{color:white}
.result-head p{color:#e4ece5}
.result-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;
padding:15px;margin:12px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.result-card.high{border-left:5px solid var(--green)}
.result-card.medium{border-left:5px solid var(--gold)}
.result-card.backup{border-left:5px solid var(--brown)}
.result-card li{margin:7px 0}
footer{background:var(--forest);color:#e4ece5;padding:23px;text-align:center}
@media(max-width:700px){
 .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
 .field-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .field.full{grid-column:auto}
 .panel{padding:15px}
 .btn{width:100%}
}
@media print{
 header{background:white;color:black;padding:10px}
 header p,.eyebrow{color:#333}
 body{background:white}
 .panel{break-inside:avoid}
 .toolbar,.no-print,button{display:none!important}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eyebrow">PathKeeper · Website Operations</div>
 <h1>Site Strategy & Page Planning System</h1>
 <p>
 Turn your existing page inventory into an organized editing plan.
 Review existing pages, add missing pages, improve connections, and
 generate a strategy with a backup plan based on your answers.
 </p>
</div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">

<section class="panel">
 <h2>How this version works</h2>
 <p>
 This tool combines your questionnaire, page inventory, editing decisions,
 page-content suggestions, and link recommendations.
 </p>
 <div class="note">
 <strong>Preservation rule:</strong> The planner does not delete pages from
 Google Sites. Keep, Merge, Move, Review, Create, and Remove are planning
 decisions only. Verify content and links before making changes to the live site.
 </div>
 <div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><strong id="pageCount">0</strong><span class="small">Inventory entries</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><strong id="addedCount">0</strong><span class="small">Added by you</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><strong id="mergeCount">0</strong><span class="small">Merge candidates</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><strong id="createCount">0</strong><span class="small">Create candidates</span></div>
 </div>
 <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div></div>
 <p class="small" id="progressText">Review the inventory and questionnaire to build your plan.</p>
</section>

<section class="panel" id="inventory">
 <h2>01. PathKeeper page inventory</h2>
 <p class="muted section-intro">
 These entries combine the page list you provided with the earlier page-content
 and link map. The suggestions are planning guidance. Confirm titles, parents,
 and current live-page status against your Google Sites Pages panel.
 </p>

 <div class="field-grid no-print">
  <div class="field">
   <label for="searchPages">Search pages</label>
   <input id="searchPages" placeholder="Search by title, parent, content, or suggestion">
  </div>
  <div class="field">
   <label for="filterAction">Filter by editing decision</label>
   <select id="filterAction">
    <option value="">All decisions</option>
    <option>Keep</option><option>Review</option><option>Merge</option>
    <option>Move</option><option>Create</option><option>Remove</option>
   </select>
  </div>
 </div>

 <div class="toolbar no-print">
  <button type="button" class="btn light" id="showAll">Show all pages</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn light" id="addPageBtn">Add a page</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn" id="downloadInventory">Download inventory CSV</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn light" id="resetInventory">Restore starter inventory</button>
 </div>

 <div class="table-wrap">
 <table>
 <thead>
 <tr>
  <th>Page title</th>
  <th>Parent / proposed location</th>
  <th>Decision</th>
  <th>Status</th>
  <th>Purpose / suggested content</th>
  <th>Buttons / related pages</th>
  <th>Published URL</th>
  <th>Notes / next action</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody id="pageRows"></tbody>
 </table>
 </div>
 <p class="small" id="inventoryStatus" aria-live="polite">
 Changes are used in the generated report. Download a backup to preserve them.
 </p>
</section>

<section class="panel">
 <h2>02. Strategy questionnaire</h2>
 <p class="muted">
 Answer what you know. You can leave questions blank. Your answers are combined
 with the page inventory to create the strategy and backup plan.
 </p>

 <form id="strategyForm">

 <h3>A. Mission and visitors</h3>
 <div class="field-grid">
  <div class="question">
   <label for="audience">1. Who should PathKeeper help first?</label>
   <select id="audience">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Students</option><option>Career changers</option>
    <option>Job seekers</option><option>Aspiring business owners</option>
    <option>People developing skills</option><option>Several audiences</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="mission">2. What is the main result visitors should achieve?</label>
   <textarea id="mission" placeholder="What should a visitor be able to do after using the site?"></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="problem">3. What problem does PathKeeper solve?</label>
   <textarea id="problem" placeholder="Describe the problem in practical terms."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="homepage">4. What is the homepage plan?</label>
   <select id="homepage">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Build a focused landing page to replace the current homepage</option>
    <option>Improve the existing homepage</option>
    <option>Create a new homepage and preserve useful old content</option>
   </select>
  </div>
 </div>

 <h3>B. Page structure and editing</h3>
 <div class="field-grid">
  <div class="question">
   <label for="mainBlocker">5. What is the biggest current obstacle?</label>
   <select id="mainBlocker">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Too many pages or drafts</option><option>Unclear parent pages</option>
    <option>Duplicate content</option><option>Missing content</option>
    <option>Missing links</option><option>Design and layout</option>
    <option>Technical problems</option><option>Not enough time</option>
    <option>Unclear priorities</option><option>Finding visitors</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="navPlan">6. What should the main navigation contain?</label>
   <textarea id="navPlan" placeholder="Suggested: Home, Intelligence Center, Opportunity Atlas, Mobility & Location, Career Planning, Resource Vault, About & How to Use."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="pagePolicy">7. How should duplicate pages be handled?</label>
   <select id="pagePolicy">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Compare content and merge only after preserving unique information</option>
    <option>Keep separate until I review each page</option>
    <option>Review duplicate drafts in groups by topic</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="newPages">8. What additional pages should be created?</label>
   <textarea id="newPages" placeholder="Add page titles and explain what each should do. These suggestions will be included in the report."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="contentNeeds">9. What information is missing from existing pages?</label>
   <textarea id="contentNeeds" placeholder="Examples: explanations, steps, eligibility, official links, cost comparisons, templates, examples."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="pageOrder">10. Which pages must be completed first?</label>
   <textarea id="pageOrder" placeholder="List the pages that matter most to launch."></textarea>
  </div>
 </div>

 <h3>C. Buttons, links, and visitor journey</h3>
 <div class="field-grid">
  <div class="question">
   <label for="primaryAction">11. What is the main visitor action?</label>
   <select id="primaryAction">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Explore opportunities</option><option>Use the Free Library</option>
    <option>Build a career plan</option><option>Research a location</option>
    <option>Use a learning tool</option><option>Create evidence of work</option>
    <option>Purchase a service or product</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="buttonNeeds">12. Which buttons need destinations or clearer labels?</label>
   <textarea id="buttonNeeds" placeholder="List the button label, current page, and intended destination if known."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="visitorFlow">13. What should the visitor journey be?</label>
   <textarea id="visitorFlow" placeholder="Example: Home → Opportunity Atlas → Intelligence Center → Career Planning → Execution & Progress → WorkProof."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="linksState">14. How complete are internal links?</label>
   <select id="linksState">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Mostly complete and tested</option><option>Some missing</option>
    <option>Many missing</option><option>Not tested on the published site</option>
   </select>
  </div>
 </div>

 <h3>D. Design, resources, and proof of work</h3>
 <div class="field-grid">
  <div class="question">
   <label for="design">15. What visual direction should the site use?</label>
   <select id="design">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Forest green, cream, and brown</option>
    <option>Dark green with warm neutral accents</option>
    <option>Light and minimal</option>
    <option>Compare multiple color combinations</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="images">16. What should happen to pictures?</label>
   <select id="images">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Remove decorative pictures unless useful</option>
    <option>Keep instructional visuals and evidence images</option>
    <option>Use images to show proof of work</option>
    <option>Review each image individually</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="proof">17. What proof-of-work features are needed?</label>
   <textarea id="proof" placeholder="Examples: image evidence, project records, certificates, completed tasks, portfolio links."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="resourceTypes">18. What should the Resource Vault include?</label>
   <textarea id="resourceTypes" placeholder="Examples: templates, guides, checklists, official links, learning resources, grant resources."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="mobile">19. What is the mobile readiness status?</label>
   <select id="mobile">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Tested and usable</option><option>Needs improvement</option>
    <option>Not tested yet</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="automation">20. Which interactive features matter most?</label>
   <textarea id="automation" placeholder="Examples: guided questionnaires, calculators, search filters, checklists, downloads, progress tracking."></textarea>
  </div>
 </div>

 <h3>E. Opportunities, business, and discovery</h3>
 <div class="field-grid">
  <div class="question">
   <label for="opportunities">21. Which opportunity categories are priorities?</label>
   <textarea id="opportunities" placeholder="Scholarships, funding, certificates, study abroad, competitions, internships, startups, and other categories."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="offerings">22. What products or services should be considered?</label>
   <textarea id="offerings" placeholder="Describe possible paid services, digital products, templates, or custom work."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="monetization">23. How should paid offerings be approached?</label>
   <select id="monetization">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Keep the site free for now</option>
    <option>Free tools with optional paid resources</option>
    <option>Test one service before building more</option>
    <option>Research demand and competitor pricing first</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="traffic">24. How should people discover PathKeeper?</label>
   <select id="traffic">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Search engines and useful content</option>
    <option>Direct sharing and referrals</option>
    <option>Social media</option>
    <option>Partnerships</option>
    <option>Several channels</option>
   </select>
  </div>
 </div>

 <h3>F. Time, risks, and backup plan</h3>
 <div class="field-grid">
  <div class="question">
   <label for="time">25. How much time is available each week?</label>
   <select id="time">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Under 2 hours</option><option>2–4 hours</option>
    <option>5–7 hours</option><option>8–12 hours</option>
    <option>More than 12 hours</option><option>Varies</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="budget">26. What is the available budget?</label>
   <select id="budget">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>$0 — free tools only</option><option>Under $50</option>
    <option>$50–$200</option><option>$200–$500</option>
    <option>Depends on evidence of demand</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="risk">27. What could cause the project to stall?</label>
   <textarea id="risk" placeholder="Examples: scope expansion, unfinished pages, untested links, time, budget, or missing information."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="fallback">28. If the original plan fails, what is the preferred fallback?</label>
   <select id="fallback">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Launch a smaller useful version</option>
    <option>Focus on one audience</option>
    <option>Focus on one page or tool</option>
    <option>Improve existing pages gradually</option>
    <option>Test one paid service separately</option>
    <option>Ask users for feedback and revise</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="success">29. How will success be measured?</label>
   <select id="success">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>Visitors complete a useful task</option>
    <option>Downloads or tool use</option>
    <option>Returning visitors</option>
    <option>Service requests or sales</option>
    <option>Completed plans and proof of work</option>
    <option>Search traffic</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="deadline">30. When should the first milestone be reached?</label>
   <select id="deadline">
    <option value="">Choose or leave blank</option>
    <option>7 days</option><option>30 days</option>
    <option>60 days</option><option>90 days</option>
   </select>
  </div>
  <div class="question">
   <label for="extraNotes">31. Any other details the strategy must consider?</label>
   <textarea id="extraNotes" placeholder="Include constraints, additional pages, important suggestions, or corrections."></textarea>
  </div>
 </div>

 <div class="toolbar">
  <button class="btn" type="button" id="generate">Generate Strategy + Backup Plan</button>
  <button class="btn light" type="button" id="downloadReport">Download Strategy Report</button>
  <button class="btn light" type="button" id="downloadJSON">Download Project Backup (JSON)</button>
  <button class="btn brown" type="button" id="downloadChecklist">Download Action Checklist</button>
 </div>
 <p id="status" class="small" aria-live="polite">Complete what you can, then generate your report.</p>
 </form>
</section>

<section class="panel result" id="results" aria-live="polite">
 <div id="reportContent"></div>
 <div class="toolbar no-print">
  <button class="btn" type="button" id="downloadAgain">Download this report</button>
  <button class="btn light" type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button>
 </div>
</section>

</main>
<footer>PathKeeper · Strategy, page structure, useful connections, and practical execution.</footer>

